nd(x) = floor(x) if α ≤ 0.5, else ceil(x) if α > 0.5. Similarly for y.\nThen s = floor(x) + floor(y) + correction, where correction is: if round(x) is ceil(x), then add 1; if round(y) is ceil(y), then add 1.\n\nAlternatively, we can express s in terms of floor(x) and floor(y) with possible increases.\n\nWe want s = N/2 for even N. So floor(N/3)+floor(N/5) + possibly 1 or 2 (or 0) = N/2.\n\nSimilarly for odd N, floor(N/3)+floor(N/5) + (possible adjustments) = (N±1)/2.\n\nMaybe we can solve digit by digit analysis.\n\nLet\'s search numerically beyond small numbers. We already checked even N up to 36, and found N=6,10,12,16 work. Possibly more: N=2? 2/2=1, round(2/3)=1, round(2/5)=1, sum=3, not 2. So N=2 doesn\'t work. N=14 didn\'t work (14/2=7, round(14/3)=5, round(14/5)=3, sum=8, not 7). N=18 didn\'t work (9, round(18/3)=6, round(18/5)=4, sum=10). N=20 didn\'t work (10, round(20/3)=7, round(20/5)=4, sum=11). N=24 didn\'t work (12, round(24/3)=8, round(24/5)=5, sum=13). N=30 didn\'t work (15, round(30/3)=10, round(30/5)=6, sum=16). N=32 didn\'t work (16, round(32/3)=11, round(32/5)=6, sum=17). N=36 didn\'t work (18, round(36/3)=12, round(36/5)=7, sum=19). N=40: L=20, round(40/3)=13.333 -> 13 or 14? 40/3=13.333, nearest 13, sum=20+13+8? round(40/5)=8, exactly, so s=13+8=21, need 20, no. N=42: L=21, round(42/3)=14, round(42/5)=8.4 -> 8, s=14+8=22, need 21, no. N=48: L=24, round(48/3)=16, round(48/5)=9.6 -> 10, s=16+10=26, need 24, no. N=50: L=25, round(50/3)=16.666 -> 17, round(50/5)=10, s=17+10=27, need 25, no. N=54: L=27, round(54/3)=18, round(54/5)=10.8 -> 11, s=18+11=29, need 27, no. N=60: L=30, round(60/3)=20, round(60/5)=12, s=20+12=32, need 30, no. N=64: L=32, round(64/3)=21.333 -> 21, round(64/5)=12.8 -> 13, s=21+13=34, need 32, no. N=66: L=33, round(66/3)=22, round(66/5)=13.2 -> 13, s=22+13=35, need 33, no. N=70: L=35, round(70/3)=23.333 -> 23, round(70/5)=14, s=23+14=37, need 35, no. N=72: L=36, round(72/3)=24, round(72/5)=14.4 -> 14, s=24+14=38, need 36, no. N=78: L=39, round(78/3)=26, round(78/5)=15.6 -> 16, s=26+16=42, need 39, no. N=80: L=40, round(80/3)=26.666 -> 27, round(80/5)=16, s=27+16=43, need 40, no. N=84: L=42, round(84/3)=28, round(84/5)=16.8 -> 17, s=28+17=45, need 42, no. N=90: L=45, round(90/3)=30, round(90/5)=18, s=30+18=48, need 45, no. N=96: L=48, round(96/3)=32, round(96/5)=19.2 -> 19, s=32+19=51, need 48, no. N=100: L=50, round(100/3)=33.333 -> 33, round(100/5)=20, s=33+20=53, need 50, no.\n\nIt seems even N less than, say, 100 don\'t work except those we already found: 4,6,10,12,16. Possibly N=18? Already didn\'t work. N=22: L=11, round(22/3)=7.333 -> 7, round(22/5)=4.4 -> 4, s=7+4=11, need 11? Actually N/2=11, so s=7+4=11, works! Check: 22/2=11, round(22/3)=7.333 nearest 7? Actually 7.333, distance to 7 is 0.333, to 8 is 0.667, so nearest is 7. round(22/5)=4.4 nearest 4, sum=11. So N=22 works! I missed that. So even N=22 works.\nAlso check N=26: L=13, round(26/3)=8.666 nearest 9? 8.666, distance to 8 is 0.666, to 9 is 0.334, so nearest is 9. round(26/5)=5.2 nearest 5, s=9+5=14, need 13, no.\nN=28: L=14, round(28/3)=9.333 nearest 9, round(28/5)=5.6 nearest 6, s=9+6=15, need 14, no.\nN=30 didn\'t work.\nN=34: L=17, round(34/3)=11.333 nearest 11? Actually 11.333, distance to 11 is 0.333, to 12 is 0.667, so nearest 11, round(34/5)=6.8 nearest 7, s=11+7=18, need 17, no.\nN=38: L=19, round(38/3)=12.666 nearest 13? 12.666, distance to 12 is 0.666, to 13 is 0.334, so nearest 13, round(38/5)=7.6 nearest 8, s=13+8=21, need 19, no.\nN=42 already tried.\nN=46: L=23, round(46/3)=15.333 nearest 15, round(46/5)=9.2 nearest 9, s=15+9=24, need 23, no.\nN=48 didn\'t work.\nN=52: L=26, round(52/3)=17.333 nearest 17, round(52/5)=10.4 nearest 10, s=17+10=27, need 26, no.\nN=54 didn\'t work.\nN=58: L=29, round(58/3)=19.333 nearest 19, round(58/5)=11.6 nearest 12, s=19+12=31, need 29, no.\nN=62: L=31, round(62/3)=20.666 nearest 21, round(62/5)=12.4 nearest 12, s=21+12=33, need 31, no.\nN=66 already tried.\nN=70,72 tried