33 nearest 0, 1/5=0.2 nearest 0, so sum: if L=0: 0+0+0=1; if L=1: 1+0+0=1. Both work! So N=1 works (with L=0 or 1). But 1 is a crowd? Possibly the smallest.\nN=3: N odd, c=floor(3/2)=1, L can be 1 or 2. round(3/3)=1, round(3/5)=0, so if L=1: 1+1+0=2, not 3; if L=2: 2+1+0=3, works. So N=3 works (with L=2).\nN=5: c=2, L=2 or 3. round(5/3)=1.666 nearest 2, round(5/5)=1, so if L=2: 2+2+1=5, works; if L=3: 3+2+1=6, no. So N=5 works.\nN=7: c=3, L=3 or 4. round(7/3)=2.333 nearest 2, round(7/5)=1.4 nearest 1, so if L=3: 3+2+1=6, not 7; if L=4: 4+2+1=7, works. So N=7 works.\nN=9: c=4, L=4 or 5. round(9/3)=3, round(9/5)=1.8 nearest 2, so if L=4: 4+3+2=9, works; if L=5: 5+3+2=10, no. So N=9 works.\nN=11: c=5, L=5 or 6. round(11/3)=3.666 nearest 4, round(11/5)=2.2 nearest 2, so if L=5: 5+4+2=11, works; if L=6: 6+4+2=12, no. So N=11 works.\nN=13: c=6, L=6 or 7. round(13/3)=4.333 nearest 4, round(13/5)=2.6 nearest 3, so if L=6: 6+4+3=13, works; if L=7: 7+4+3=14, no. So N=13 works.\nN=15: c=7, L=7 or 8. round(15/3)=5, round(15/5)=3, so if L=7: 7+5+3=15, works; if L=8: 8+5+3=16, no. So N=15 works.\nN=17 we already saw works (with L=8).\nN=19: c=9, L=9 or 10. round(19/3)=6.333 nearest 6, round(19/5)=3.8 nearest 4, so if L=9: 9+6+4=19, works; if L=10: 10+6+4=20, no. So N=19 works.\nN=21: c=10, L=10 or 11. round(21/3)=7, round(21/5)=4.2 nearest 4, so if L=10: 10+7+4=21, works; if L=11: 11+7+4=22, no. So N=21 works.\nN=23: c=11, L=11 or 12. round(23/3)=7.666 nearest 8, round(23/5)=4.6 nearest 5, so if L=11: 11+8+5=24, not 23; if L=12: 12+8+5=25, no. So N=23 does not work.\nN=25: c=12, L=12 or 13. round(25/3)=8.333 nearest 8, round(25/5)=5, so if L=12: 12+8+5=25, works; if L=13: 13+8+5=26, no. So N=25 works.\nN=27: c=13, L=13 or 14. round(27/3)=9, round(27/5)=5.4 nearest 5, so if L=13: 13+9+5=27, works; if L=14: 14+9+5=28, no. So N=27 works.\nN=29: c=14, L=14 or 15. round(29/3)=9.666 nearest 10, round(29/5)=5.8 nearest 6, so if L=14: 14+10+6=30, no; if L=15: 15+10+6=31, no. So N=29 does